  "description": "A production-grade C#/.NET 8 library for Healthcare Data Interoperability. Features: FHIR R4 client utilities, HIPAA compliance helpers (RBAC, PHI Encryption, Audit Log), US Core profile conformance checker, SMART on FHIR auth, AI-driven data normalization via local LLMs (Ollama), CSV-to-FHIR ETL pipeline, and Serilog integration. Portfolio snapshot - no maintenance.",
